<title>USA: CKE 2.5 mln shr offering priced.</title>
<headline>CKE 2.5 mln shr offering priced.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CKE Restaurants Inc said its public offering of 2,500,000 shares of common stock was priced at $28.625 per share.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay up to $36 million aggregate principal amount of indebtedness under the company's unsecured credit facility and for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
